ull,null,null],["Not recorded = unavailable metadata. Not assessed = MOSAD stopped by user before assessment.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["The added F0.5 evaluates events associated with channels 40–47 using the same run and assessment period as each row.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["28 October: temporal processing retained all three W&B alarm rules. Scores unchanged. Full comparison is in the temporal-processing report.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["W&B: seed 42, reused benchmark, calibration-only selection. Extra inputs: 14, 21, 29. Short-no-roll LR1e-5 repeats prior work.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]]